%% ===== 时序一：周报提交 → 确认人收到 → 确认/打回 =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 填报人
    participant FE as ReportsPage
    participant API as report.service
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant C as 确认人
    participant Bell as TodoBell/useTodos

    A->>FE: 填写周报并提交(submit=true)
    FE->>API: POST /api/projects/:pid/reports {submit:true}
    API->>DB: INSERT work_reports(status='已提交', submitted_at=now)
    API-->>FE: Report(已提交)

    Note over C, Bell: 确认人侧拉取待确认
    Bell->>API: GET /api/reports/pending-confirmation
    API->>DB: SELECT work_reports WHERE status='已提交'
    API->>API: 逐条 resolveConfirmers(projectId, author)
    API-->>Bell: Report[] (仅含 currentUser ∈ 确认人集合)
    Bell-->>C: 铃铛徽标计数 + 下拉条目

    C->>FE: 点击「确认」/「打回」
    alt 确认
        FE->>API: POST /api/projects/:pid/reports/:id/confirm
        API->>API: 校验 currentUser ∈ resolveConfirmers
        API->>DB: UPDATE work_reports SET status='已确认', confirmed_by, confirmed_at
        API-->>FE: Report(已确认)
    else 打回(原因必填)
        FE->>API: POST /api/projects/:pid/reports/:id/reject {rejectReason}
        API->>API: 校验原因非空 + 权限
        API->>DB: UPDATE work_reports SET status='草稿', reject_reason
        API-->>FE: Report(草稿)
    end

%% ===== 时序二：待办中心前端并发聚合 =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Top as Topbar(TodoBell)
    participant H as useTodos
    participant S1 as GET /api/approvals
    participant S2 as GET /api/dashboard/overview
    participant S3 as GET /api/workbench
    participant S4 as GET /api/.../wbs
    participant S5 as GET /api/reports/pending-confirmation

    Top->>H: 打开铃铛(onOpen)
    par 并发拉取六类源
        H->>S1: 待我审批
        H->>S2: reportMissing(待填周报)
        H->>S3: myTasks(指派/逾期)
        H->>S4: wbs(status='阻塞' + 逾期筛选)
        H->>S5: 待确认周报
    end
    S1-->>H: Approval[]
    S2-->>H: { reportMissing: [] }
    S3-->>H: { myTasks: [] }
    S4-->>H: WbsNode[]
    S5-->>H: Report[]
    H->>H: 归一为 TodoItem[] 并按 type 分组/排序
    H-->>Top: { total, groups[] }
    Top->>Top: 徽标显 total；下拉按组渲染；点条目 navigate(targetRoute)
